Notice that AutocompleteProps
is configurable. The caller can control debounce timing, minimum character threshold, and maximum suggestions. This makes the component reusable across different contexts.
Step 1: Basic Search Input
We start with the simplest possible version: a controlled input that tracks what the user types.
