className="autocomplete-dropdown"
style={{ opacity: isStale ? 0.7 : 1 }}
>
This is most useful when filtering a large local dataset. If you are fetching from a remote API with debouncing, useDeferredValue
adds little benefit because the network latency already creates a natural delay.
